<p>Users who work with both Org mode and Markdown formatted text should find interest in the <a href="https://kickingvegas.github.io/anju/Org-_201cCopy-as_2026_201d-Context-Menu.html">Copy as…</a> capability added to the Org mode context menu. This feature lets one use Org mode as the primary means of authoring text, exporting to Markdown (or another format) using a right-click mouse copy action.</p>
<p><img alt="img" src="images/anju-1-5/anju-context-menu-org-copy-as.png"></p>
<p>Thanks to Marcin Borkowski whose post <a href="https://mbork.pl/2021-05-02_Org-mode_to_Markdown_via_the_clipboard">“Org-mode to Markdown via the clipboard”</a>, inspired this feature.</p>
<p>Anju also provides a complementary command “Paste Markdown as Org” for Org mode which lets one paste copied Markdown text into an Org file, doing the conversion of Markdown to Org under the hood using <code>pandoc</code>.</p>
<p><img alt="img" src="images/anju-1-5/anju-paste-markdown-as-org.png"></p>
<p>In summary, this is a big release with many changes. I invite you to explore all the links above to see what’s available in Anju.</p>